// Per-request only (no aggregate relayed); the c16 level collapsed (gap 443 ms, TTFT 21 s) and is capacity-boundary evidence.
// The operator marked this cell to be re-measured.

// Upstream log, H200 at gpu-memory-utilization 0.95: available KV 1.53 GiB against 4.21 GiB (FP8 KV) / 7.57 GiB (BF16 KV)
// for one 262,144-token request (estimated max length 51,200 / 25,600). The checkpoint loads but cannot serve the length.
data h200_fp8w_refusal_cause: NonEmptyStr = "upstream refused to start: available KV 1.53 GiB at gpu-memory-utilization 0.95 is below the 4.21 GiB (FP8 KV) or 7.57 GiB (BF16 KV) one 262144-token request needs; estimated max model len 51200 (FP8 KV) / 25600 (BF16 KV)" as NonEmptyStr

